o sections.</p><span className="text-link">Open media <ArrowUpRight size={13}/></span></Link><Link className="step-card" href="/admin/enquiries"><Users size={20}/><h3>Contact enquiries</h3><p>Review messages and track response status.</p><span className="text-link">Open enquiries <ArrowUpRight size={13}/></span></Link></div></div><div className="admin-panel"><div className="admin-panel-head"><h2>Operational checklist</h2></div><div className="content-list"><div className="content-row"><div><h3><ShieldCheck size={15} style={{display:"inline",marginRight:7}}/>Security and access</h3><p>Keep owner access restricted, review database policies, and rotate credentials if exposed.</p></div><Link className="text-link" href="/admin/content?type=profile">Review <ArrowUpRight size={13}/></Link></div><div className="content-row"><div><h3><FileText size={15} style={{display:"inline",marginRight:7}}/>Content quality</h3><p>Replace sample project wording with genuine work, source notes, and appropriate disclosures.</p></div><Link className="text-link" href="/admin/content?type=project">Review projects <ArrowUpRight size={13}/></Link></div><div className="content-row"><div><h3><Users size={15} style={{display:"inline",marginRight:7}}/>Contact handling</h3><p>Configure a response process and retention policy before accepting public enquiries.</p></div><Link className="text-link" href="/contact">View contact page <ArrowUpRight size={13}/></Link></div></div></div></AdminShell>}
